#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Color Tuner — sliders for the monitor calibration curve (GNOME / Wayland / colord).

The program builds an ICC profile from the monitor's EDID profile, adds a
calibration curve (vcgt) to it and makes it the monitor's default profile via
colord. GNOME (mutter) then loads that curve into the graphics card.
"""
